; What the example's songs share: the looping pad sample both BGMs hold. The
; effects are not here — they are the GAME's, in demo-se.mmlisp, which the
; bundle gives every song (demo.bundle.json "se").

; An imported sample def reads its :file from THIS file's directory.
(def-pcm padsmp :file "pad.wav" :loop-start 9ms :loop-end 36ms)
